shell: sendtmx = custom script to send arbitrary commands to tmux
nvim: Alt-L = write sendtmx in command mode and wait for command string to be sent
tmux: Alt-; = enter copy mode in tmux, refer to .tmux.conf
tmux: jk does vim-like scrolling, refer to .tmux.conf
terminal: default terminal changed to foot from alacritty (experimental)
tmux: Alt+F = Send tmux_script.sh custom script to tmux session and execute
